{"availability":"available","full":"langchain-ai/langchainjs","name":"langchainjs","description":"The agent engineering platform","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":18252,"forks":3422,"created":"2023-02-06T22:50:27Z","updated":"2026-10-08T23:17:32Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://docs.langchain.com/langchain/","topics":[],"demo":"https://docs.langchain.com/oss/javascript/langchain/mcp","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2105744481408716955","postId":"2105744481408716955","postedAt":"2026-10-01T19:39:41.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z","stars":18252,"forks":3422}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["LangChain is a framework for building LLM-powered applications. It helps you chain together interoperable components and third-party integrations to simplify AI application development — all while future-proofing decisions as the underlying technology evolves.","Just getting started? Check out Deep Agents — a higher-level package built on LangChain for agents that have built-in capabilities for common usage patterns such as planning, subagents, file system usage, and more.","If you're looking for more advanced customization or agent orchestration, check out LangGraph.js, our framework for building agents and controllable workflows."],"features":["Real-time data augmentation. Easily connect LLMs to diverse data sources and external/internal systems, drawing from LangChain’s vast library of integrations with model providers, tools, vector stores, retrievers, and…","Model interoperability. Swap models in and out as your engineering team experiments to find the best choice for your application’s needs. As the industry frontier evolves, adapt quickly — LangChain’s abstractions keep…","Rapid prototyping. Quickly build and iterate on LLM applications with LangChain's modular, component-based architecture. Test different approaches and workflows without rebuilding from scratch, accelerating your…","Production-ready features. Deploy reliable applications with built-in support for monitoring, evaluation, and debugging through integrations like LangSmith. Scale with confidence using battle-tested patterns and best…","Vibrant community and ecosystem. Leverage a rich ecosystem of integrations, templates, and community-contributed components. Benefit from continuous improvements and stay up-to-date with the latest AI developments…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"45cd7b5db9716c6b07be8a40cf37098fb9efe9d84756992812bb9c580f1cf5f7","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T14:19:54.542Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"LangChain is a framework for building LLM-powered applications. It helps you chain together interoperable components and third-party integrations to simplify AI application development — all while future-proofing decisions as the underlying technology evolves.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"45cd7b5db9716c6b07be8a40cf37098fb9efe9d84756992812bb9c580f1cf5f7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T23:17:32Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:43.630Z","hash":"45cd7b5db9716c6b07be8a40cf37098fb9efe9d84756992812bb9c580f1cf5f7","originalBytes":6299,"storedBytes":6299,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["langchain","agents","out","check","integrations","agent"